Actually, I think I was right initially. The issue is:1. In `required_providers`, the local name must use dashes (Terraform restriction)
2. In `provider "X"`, the X must match the local name from required_providers
3. In resource types like `remote_docker_compose_file_stack`, this comes from the TypeName

